{"id":"b79e3339c6c6be47","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_S314Synth.md","title":"S314Synth","display":"S314Synth","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"S314Synth","parameters":["g","t","r"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"S314Synth"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>r</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：编号入口固定参数。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>r</code>。</p>\n<p>固定入口参数；其余参数沿被调用定义的顺序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ S314Synth g t r)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists B\n  (exists C (exists k (and (@ Omega B) (and (@ Empty C) (and (@ Empty k) (@ STSynth B C k g t r)))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b6471a8f381739eb\" href=\"?note=b6471a8f381739eb\" title=\"ZFC_Empty\">Empty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7396de782f573e5f\" href=\"?note=7396de782f573e5f\" title=\"ZFC_STSynth\">STSynth</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ S314Synth g t r)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Empty","status":"resolved","id":"b6471a8f381739eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STSynth|STSynth]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Omega","status":"resolved","id":"3bcf6cd1d43a3007","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STSynth|STSynth]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STSynth","status":"resolved","id":"7396de782f573e5f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STSynth|STSynth]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":880,"backlinks":[{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-807","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_S314Synth|S314Synth]]"},{"id":"98c0adfaf97db4aa","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_S314Synth|S314Synth]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","b6471a8f381739eb","3bcf6cd1d43a3007","7396de782f573e5f","593f9bdab4d60707"]}